<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6999 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6999 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6999 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.6000 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 12		  May 8</p>
<p> High			     75.7000		 75.6000</p>
<p> Low				75.6001		 75.4400</p>
<p> Open			     75.6999		 75.5500</p>
<p> Close			    75.6999		 75.6000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.075		   5.275</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
